# Where "Сообщить о проблеме" posts (G3).
#
# A Google Apps Script Web App deployed by the owner - "Execute as: me",
# "Who has access: Anyone". It is a DIFFERENT deployment from the reactions
# endpoint in FeedbackRepository: reports carry free text and diagnostics and
# must not land in the reactions sheet.
#
# This URL is a capability URL, not a secret in the cryptographic sense - it
# ships inside the APK and is extractable by anyone who downloads it. It stays
# untracked so a fork does not post into someone else's inbox, and so the repo
# never carries a live production address.
#
# The Telegram bot token lives in that script's Script Properties and NEVER
# here - see docs/REPORT-PROBLEM-3.6.6.md and tools/report-endpoint/.
#
# Absent or empty is a supported state: the app then has no report form at all,
# and both entry points are absent rather than dead.
REPORT_ENDPOINT=https://script.google.com/macros/s/REPLACE_ME/exec
